---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { site, project, toc, release } from "../lib/content";
---
<Base>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Independent developer / Project 01</p>
        <p class="project-name">CodiComperChat</p>
        <h1>이야기가 쌓이면,<br/>캐릭터도 <em>기억합니다.</em></h1>
        <p class="lead">{site.intro}</p>
        <div class="cta"><a class="btn copper" href="#work">프로젝트 살펴보기 ↘</a><a class="text-link" href="/files">포트폴리오 다운로드 ↓</a></div>
        <p class="hero-meta">{site.period}<br/>{site.author}</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="hero-shot">
        <div class="window-bar"><span></span><span></span><span></span><b>실제 제품 화면 / 캐릭터 대화</b></div>
        <img src="/shots/chat.jpg" width="1440" height="1000" alt="코디컴퍼챗의 실제 캐릭터 대화 화면" fetchpriority="high" />
        <figcaption><span class="live-dot"></span>대화의 맥락을 상태로 남기는 캠페인 플랫폼</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
    <div class="container hero-bottom"><span>FULL STACK DEVELOPMENT</span><span>WEB / BACKEND / AI / OPERATIONS</span><a href="#latest">개발 기록 ↓</a></div>
  </section>
  <section class="container metrics" aria-label="저장소 규모와 시험 기록">
    <div class="stats">{site.stats.map(s => <div class="stat"><strong>{s.value}</strong><span>{s.label}</span></div>)}</div>
    <p class="small muted">{site.evidenceNote}</p>
  </section>
  <section class="container block" id="latest">
    <div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Development journal / {release.date}</p><h2>최근에 만든 것과, 배운 것</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/updates">전체 개발 기록 ↗</a></div>
    <p class="section-intro">{release.summary}</p>
    <div class="journal">{release.items.map(item => <a class="journal-row" href={item.href}><time>{item.date}</time><div><span class="status-label">{item.status}</span><h3>{item.title}</h3><p>{item.text}</p></div><span class="journal-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>)}</div>
  </section>
  <section class="container block" id="work">
    <div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">The project</p><h2>대화를 넘어, 함께 이어 가는 캠페인</h2></div><span class="small muted">01 / PRODUCT THINKING</span></div>
    <div class="split project-intro"><div><p class="lead">{project.oneLine}</p><p>{project.answer}</p><a class="btn" href={site.service} target="_blank" rel="noopener">제품 사이트 열기 ↗</a></div><figure class="product-shot"><img src="/shots/world-play-visual-novel.jpg" alt="월드코퍼챗 비주얼노벨형 실제 플레이 화면" loading="lazy"/><figcaption>여러 인물이 함께하는 월드코퍼챗 · 개발 환경 캡처</figcaption></figure></div>
    <div class="features">{project.features.map((f,i) => <article class="feature"><span class="feature-no">0{i+1}</span><h3>{f.title}</h3><p>{f.text}</p></article>)}</div>
    <p class="small muted">기능은 코드 구현 기준입니다. 그림 엔진·콘솔 연결·프리미엄 등 운영에서 준비 중인 영역은 개발 기록에 따로 표시했습니다.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="framework-section" id="frameworks"><div class="container block">
    <div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Framework notes</p><h2>각 프레임워크에, 분명한 역할을</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/frameworks">선택 이유와 코드 보기 ↗</a></div>
    <p class="section-intro">제품의 상태와 권한은 Nest에, 모델 실행은 FastAPI에 모았습니다. 이 포트폴리오는 Astro·Rails·Flask로 만들고 같은 콘텐츠를 여러 파일로 발행합니다.</p>
    <div class="framework-grid"><a href="/frameworks#product"><img src="/shots/framework-product.png" alt="Next.js·Nest.js·Prisma·FastAPI의 제품 역할과 신뢰 경계" loading="lazy" width="1600" height="1000"/><span>제품 아키텍처 <b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></span></a><a href="/frameworks#portfolio"><img src="/shots/framework-portfolio.png" alt="Astro·Rails·Flask·LangGraph로 구성된 포트폴리오 구조" loading="lazy" width="1600" height="1000"/><span>포트폴리오 아키텍처 <b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></span></a></div>
  </div></section>
  <section class="container block" id="toc">
    <div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Explore the engineering</p><h2>코드 뒤의 판단을 읽어 보세요</h2></div><span class="small muted">10개 주제 / 실제 화면과 근거</span></div>
    <ol class="toc">{toc.map(t => <li><a href={`/${t.slug}`}><span class="no">{t.no}</span><span><strong>{t.title}</strong><small>{t.sub}</small></span><span class="go" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></li>)}</ol>
  </section>
  <section class="container block"><div class="closing"><div><p class="eyebrow">Read, explore, ask</p><h2>문서로 읽거나,<br/>프로젝트에 대해 물어보세요.</h2><p>Word·PDF·발표자료·기획 시트와 근거 문서를 찾는 AI 가이드를 준비했습니다.</p></div><div class="closing-actions"><a class="btn primary" href="/files">문서 내려받기 ↓</a><a class="btn" href="/chat">AI 가이드에게 질문하기 ↗</a></div></div></section>
</Base>
<style>
.hero {
  background:#101c2b;
  color:#f5f1e9;
  padding:82px 0 0;
  overflow:hidden
}
.hero-grid {
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:1fr 1.06fr;
  gap:54px;
  align-items:center
}
.hero .eyebrow {
  color:#e8a06c
}
.project-name {
  font:500 15px var(--mono);
  color:#b8c5d5;
  margin:38px 0 16px
}
.hero h1 {
  font-size:clamp(2.15rem,4.05vw,3.5rem);
  font-weight:650;
  letter-spacing:-.05em;
  line-height:1.25
}
.hero h1 em {
  font-style:normal;
  color:#e8a06c
}
.hero .lead {
  color:#b8c5d5;
  font-size:1rem;
  margin-top:26px;
  line-height:1.85
}
.cta {
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
  gap:20px;
  margin:30px 0
}
.hero .text-link {
  color:#e2e9f2
}
.hero-meta {
  color:#9baec4;
  font-size:12px;
  line-height:1.9
}
.hero-shot {
  margin:0;
  border:1px solid #40516a;
  overflow:hidden;
  border-radius:12px;
  box-shadow:0 24px 70px #0005;
  transform:rotate(-1.5deg)
}
.hero-shot img {
  width:100%;
  height:auto;
  aspect-ratio:1.4;
  object-fit:cover;
  object-position:top
}
.window-bar {
  height:34px;
  display:flex;
  gap:5px;
  align-items:center;
  padding:0 13px;
  background:#223248
}
.window-bar span {
  width:7px;
  height:7px;
  border-radius:50%;
  background:#8191a7
}
.window-bar b {
  font-size:10px;
  margin-left:10px;
  font-weight:400;
  color:#b8c5d5
}
.hero-shot figcaption {
  padding:13px 16px;
  font-size:12px;
  color:#b8c5d5;
  background:#18273b;
  margin-top:0
}
.live-dot {
  display:inline-block;
  width:6px;
  height:6px;
  background:#e8a06c;
  border-radius:50%;
  margin-right:8px
}
.hero-bottom {
  margin-top:65px;
  border-top:1px solid #3a485c;
  display:flex;
  justify-content:space-between;
  gap:16px;
  padding-block:20px;
  font:10px var(--mono);
  letter-spacing:.1em;
  color:#9baec4
}
.hero-bottom a {
  color:#e8a06c
}
.metrics {
  padding-top:34px
}
.stats {
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(6,1fr);
  gap:22px
}
.stat {
  border-left:1px solid var(--line);
  padding-left:18px
}
.stat:first-child {
  border-left:0;
  padding-left:0
}
.stat strong {
  display:block;
  font:600 38px var(--mono);
  letter-spacing:-.06em
}
.stat span {
  display:block;
  font-size:12px;
  color:var(--muted);
  margin-top:6px
}
.metrics>.small {
  margin-top:24px;
  font-size:12px
}
.block {
  padding-top:92px
}
.section-head {
  display:flex;
  justify-content:space-between;
  gap:24px;
  align-items:end
}
.section-head h2 {
  font-size:clamp(1.65rem,3vw,2.3rem);
  letter-spacing:-.04em;
  margin-bottom:0
}
.text-link {
  font-size:13px;
  text-decoration:none;
  font-weight:600
}
.section-intro {
  color:var(--muted);
  max-width:75ch;
  margin:22px 0 30px
}
.journal {
  border-top:1px solid var(--line);
  margin-top:28px
}
.journal-row {
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:75px 1fr 30px;
  gap:25px;
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  padding:27px 0;
  color:var(--ink);
  text-decoration:none;
  transition:background .15s
}
.journal-row:hover {
  background:var(--surface-2)
}
.journal-row time {
  font:500 18px var(--mono);
  color:var(--copper);
  padding-top:4px
}
.status-label {
  font-size:11px;
  color:var(--muted)
}
.journal-row h3 {
  font-size:1.2rem;
  margin:5px 0 8px
}
.journal-row p {
  font-size:14px;
  color:var(--muted);
  margin:0;
  max-width:83ch
}
.journal-arrow {
  color:var(--copper);
  font-size:24px
}
.split {
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:1fr 1.1fr;
  gap:54px;
  align-items:center
}
.project-intro {
  margin-top:32px
}
.project-intro p {
  color:var(--ink-2)
}
.product-shot {
  margin:0
}
.product-shot img {
  border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:10px;
  width:100%
}
figcaption {
  font-size:12px;
  color:var(--muted);
  margin-top:8px
}
.features {
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
  gap:34px;
  margin-top:42px
}
.feature {
  border-top:1px solid var(--line);
  padding-top:20px
}
.feature-no {
  font:12px var(--mono);
  color:var(--copper)
}
.feature h3 {
  font-size:1.1rem;
  margin-top:12px
}
.feature p {
  font-size:14px;
  color:var(--muted)
}
.framework-section {
  margin-top:84px;
  background:var(--surface-2);
  padding-bottom:65px
}
.framework-section .block {
  padding-top:60px
}
.framework-grid {
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
  gap:25px
}
.framework-grid a {
  text-decoration:none;
  color:var(--ink)
}
.framework-grid img {
  border-radius:10px;
  border:1px solid var(--line);
  width:100%;
  height:auto
}
.framework-grid span {
  display:flex;
  justify-content:space-between;
  font-size:15px;
  padding-top:15px
}
.framework-grid b {
  color:var(--copper)
}
.toc {
  list-style:none;
  padding:0;
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
  gap:0 45px;
  margin-top:30px
}
.toc li {
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)
}
.toc a {
  display:flex;
  gap:23px;
  align-items:center;
  text-decoration:none;
  color:var(--ink);
  padding:23px 0
}
.toc a:hover strong {
  color:var(--copper)
}
.toc .no {
  font:14px var(--mono);
  color:var(--copper)
}
.toc strong {
  font-size:1.05rem;
  font-weight:600
}
.toc small {
  display:block;
  font-size:12px;
  color:var(--muted);
  margin-top:3px
}
.go {
  margin-left:auto;
  color:var(--copper)
}
.closing {
  display:flex;
  justify-content:space-between;
  gap:35px;
  align-items:center;
  border-top:2px solid var(--ink);
  padding-top:36px
}
.closing h2 {
  font-size:clamp(1.7rem,3vw,2.4rem);
  letter-spacing:-.04em
}
.closing p:not(.eyebrow) {
  color:var(--muted);
  font-size:14px
}
.closing-actions {
  display:grid;
  gap:12px;
  flex-shrink:0
}
@media(max-width:1000px) {
  .hero-grid {
    gap:30px
  }
  .hero h1 {
    font-size:2.6rem
  }
  .stats {
    grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
    gap:24px
  }
  .stat:nth-child(4) {
    border:0;
    padding:0
  }
}
@media(max-width:760px) {
  .hero {
    padding-top:44px
  }
  .hero-grid,.split {
    grid-template-columns:1fr
  }
  .hero h1 {
    font-size:clamp(2rem,7.4vw,3rem)
  }
  .project-name {
    margin-top:24px
  }
  .hero-shot {
    transform:none;
    margin-top:10px
  }
  .hero-bottom {
    margin-top:34px;
    font-size:9px
  }
  .hero-bottom>span:nth-child(2) {
    display:none
  }
  .section-head {
    align-items:start;
    flex-direction:column;
    gap:15px
  }
  .block {
    padding-top:65px
  }
  .framework-grid,.toc {
    grid-template-columns:1fr
  }
  .features {
    grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
    gap:18px
  }
  .journal-row {
    grid-template-columns:50px 1fr 20px;
    gap:12px
  }
  .journal-row time {
    font-size:14px
  }
  .journal-row h3 {
    font-size:1.05rem
  }
  .stat strong {
    font-size:31px
  }
  .stat span {
    font-size:11px
  }
  .closing {
    display:block
  }
  .closing-actions {
    margin-top:24px
  }
  .hero .cta {
    gap:17px
  }
  .hero-shot figcaption {
    font-size:11px
  }
}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce) {
  * {
    transition:none!important
  }
}
</style>
